0..73 Comment "// Effect handlers and the exits through them, after Plotkin and Pretnar,"
74..152 Comment "// _Handling Algebraic Effects_ (doi:10.2168/LMCS-9(4:23)2013): an operation\'s"
153..230 Comment "// clause may resume the handled body through its continuation or discard it,"
231..305 Comment "// a body\'s `pure` value passes through the handler\'s `pure` clause, and a"
306..383 Comment "// `return` leaves the handler with its value as it stands. A tail call is an"
384..458 Comment "// exit too, so every `become` here is written: the exits are the subject."
